## README Requirement

Every component folder must contain a `README.md` before the task is considered complete. Create it automatically if missing.

Minimum structure:

```md
# App<Name>

One-sentence description of purpose.

## Variants

| Variant | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| primary | … |

## States

| State    | Prop                  | Default |
|----------|-----------------------|---------|
| Default  | —                     | —       |
| Disabled | `disabled={true}`     | false   |
| Loading  | `isLoading={true}`    | false   |

## Usage

\`\`\`tsx
<App<Name> variant="primary" onClick={() => {}} />
\`\`\`
```
